msgid "Add tab"
msgstr "Tilføj fane"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:227
msgid ""
"Add a tab (group) to a form. First use the tabs tool if you need existing "
"tab IDs. When a form has multiple tabs, also add tab_next / tab_previous "
"fields with field-add as needed."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj en fane (gruppe) til en formular. Brug først faner-værktøjet, hvis du "
"har brug for eksisterende fane-id'er. Når en formular har flere faner, skal "
"du også tilføje tab_next / tab_previous-felter med field-add efter behov."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:273
msgid "Update tab"
msgstr "Opdater fane"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:274
msgid "Update a tab label by tab ID. Use the tabs tool to get tab IDs."
msgstr ""
"Opdater en faneetiket efter fane-id. Brug faner-værktøjet til at få fane-"
"id'er."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:318
msgid "Delete tab"
msgstr "Slet fane"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:319
msgid ""
"Permanently delete a tab and its sections/fields. Cannot delete the last tab "
"on a form. Use the tabs tool to get tab IDs."
msgstr ""
"Slet permanent en fane og dens sektioner/felter. Den sidste fane på en "
"formular kan ikke slettes. Brug faner-værktøjet til at få fane-id'er."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:358
msgid "Add section"
msgstr "Tilføj sektion"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:359
msgid ""
"Add a section to a tab. Use tabs to get group_id (tab id), and sections if "
"inserting before another section."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj en sektion til en fane. Brug faner til at hente group_id (fane-id), "
"og sektioner hvis du indsætter før en anden sektion."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:416
msgid "Update section"
msgstr "Opdater sektion"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:417
msgid ""
"Update a section label and/or meta (label_render). Use the sections tool to "
"get section IDs."
msgstr ""
"Opdater en sektions etiket og/eller meta (label_render). Brug sektioner-"
"værktøjet til at få sektions-id'er."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:467
msgid "Delete section"
msgstr "Slet sektion"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:468
msgid ""
"Permanently delete a section and its fields. Cannot delete the last section "
"on a tab. Use the sections tool to get section IDs."
msgstr ""
"Slet permanent en sektion og dens felter. Den sidste sektion på en fane kan "
"ikke slettes. Brug sektioner-værktøjet til at få sektions-id'er."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:511
msgid "List actions"
msgstr "Vis handlinger"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:512
msgid ""
"Returns form actions (including Send Email notifications) with row_id, "
"index, type id, label, and meta_summary. Prefer row_id for action-update and "
"action-delete. Form notifications are Send Email actions, not form settings."
msgstr ""
"Returnerer formularhandlinger (inklusive Send Email-notifikationer) med "
"row_id, indeks, type-id, etiket og meta_summary. Foretræk row_id til action-"
"update og action-delete. Formularnotifikationer er Send Email-handlinger, "
"ikke formularindstillinger."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:554
msgid "Add action"
msgstr "Tilføj handling"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:555
msgid ""
"Add a form action such as a Send Email notification. Prefer this over form-"
"update-json for adding notifications. For the person completing the form, "
"set meta.to to #field(id) for their email field. Returns a stable row_id."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj en formularhandling såsom en Send Email-notifikation. Foretræk dette "
"frem for form-update-json til at tilføje notifikationer. For personen, der "
"udfylder formularen, skal du sætte meta.to til #field(id) for deres e-"
"mailfelt. Returnerer et stabilt row_id."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:609
msgid "Update action"
msgstr "Opdater handling"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:610
msgid ""
"Update an action by row_id (preferred), index, or unique label_match. Use "
"the actions tool first. Prefer this for editing email notifications."
msgstr ""
"Opdater en handling efter row_id (foretrukket), indeks eller entydig "
"label_match. Brug først actions-værktøjet. Foretræk dette til redigering af "
"e-mailnotifikationer."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:660
msgid "Delete action"
msgstr "Slet handling"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:661
msgid ""
"Delete an action by row_id (preferred), index, or unique label_match. Cannot "
"delete the last email, message, or database action."
msgstr ""
"Slet en handling efter row_id (foretrukket), indeks eller entydig "
"label_match. Kan ikke slette den sidste e-mail-, besked- eller "
"databasehandling."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:696
msgid "List conditionals"
msgstr "Vis betingelser"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:697
msgid ""
"Returns form conditionals with row_id, index, label, and a short IF/THEN "
"summary. Prefer row_id for conditional-update and conditional-delete."
msgstr ""
"Returnerer formularbetingelser med row_id, indeks, etiket og en kort IF/THEN-"
"opsummering. Foretræk row_id til conditional-update og conditional-delete."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:738
msgid "Add conditional"
msgstr "Tilføj betingelse"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:739
msgid ""
"Add a conditional logic rule. Use the same AI shape as form-create-json "
"conditionals. Action targets use action row_id from the actions tool."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj en regel for betinget logik. Brug samme AI-format som betingelserne i "
"form-create-json. Handlingsmål bruger handlingens row_id fra værktøjet "
"Handlinger."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:779
msgid "Update conditional"
msgstr "Opdater betingelse"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:780
msgid ""
"Replace a conditional by row_id (preferred), index, or unique label_match. "
"Pass the full conditional object in AI shape."
msgstr ""
"Erstat en betingelse efter row_id (foretrukket), indeks eller unik "
"label_match. Send hele betingelsesobjektet i AI-format."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:824
msgid "Delete conditional"
msgstr "Slet betingelse"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability-structure.php:825
msgid ""
"Delete a conditional by row_id (preferred), index, or unique label_match. "
"Use the conditionals tool first."
msgstr ""
"Slet en betingelse efter row_id (foretrukket), indeks eller entydig "
"label_match. Brug først conditionals-værktøjet."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:27
msgid "List forms"
msgstr "Vis formularer"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:28
msgid "Returns a list of all of the forms in WS Form."
msgstr "Returnerer en liste over alle formularer i WS Form."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:122
msgid "Create form from a description"
msgstr "Opret formular ud fra en beskrivelse"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:123
msgid ""
"Use this tool to create a new form from a description provided by the user. "
"The tool generates the form using a JSON definition that must follow the "
"required structure described in the json input property. Form email "
"notifications are Send Email actions in the actions array, not form settings."
msgstr ""
"Brug dette værktøj til at oprette en ny formular ud fra en beskrivelse, som "
"brugeren har angivet. Værktøjet genererer formularen ved hjælp af en JSON-"
"definition, der skal følge den krævede struktur, som er beskrevet i json "
"input-egenskaben. Formularens e-mailnotifikationer er Send Email-handlinger "
"i actions-arrayet, ikke formularindstillinger."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:215
msgid "Get form in JSON format"
msgstr "Hent formular i JSON-format"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:216
msgid ""
"Returns the form in JSON format by ID, including fields, actions, and "
"conditionals. Form email notifications are Send Email actions in the actions "
"array (not form settings). Use with form-update-json to edit notifications."
msgstr ""
"Returnerer formularen i JSON-format efter ID, inklusive felter, handlinger "
"og betingelser. Formularens e-mailnotifikationer er Send e-mail-handlinger i "
"handlinger-arrayet (ikke formularindstillinger). Brug sammen med form-update-"
"json til at redigere notifikationer."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:276
msgid "Update a form from a JSON string"
msgstr "Opdater en formular ud fra en JSON-streng"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:277
msgid ""
"Use this tool to modify an existing form using JSON from form-get-json. "
"Prefer field-update for single-field label or meta changes. Use this tool to "
"add or edit form email notifications by updating the actions array (Send "
"Email actions). Notifications are not in form settings. To email the person "
"completing the form, set an email action meta.to to #field(id) for their "
"email field. To add a new field, use field-add instead. Keep the same groups/"
"sections/fields structure. When actions or conditionals are included, they "
"replace the form actions or conditionals."
msgstr ""
"Brug dette værktøj til at ændre en eksisterende formular ved hjælp af JSON "
"fra form-get-json. Foretræk field-update til ændringer af et enkelt felts "
"etiket eller metadata. Brug dette værktøj til at tilføje eller redigere "
"formularens e-mailnotifikationer ved at opdatere actions-arrayet (Send Email-"
"handlinger). Notifikationer findes ikke i formularindstillingerne. For at "
"sende e-mail til personen, der udfylder formularen, skal du sætte en e-"
"mailhandlings meta.to til #field(id) for deres e-mailfelt. For at tilføje et "
"nyt felt skal du i stedet bruge field-add. Behold den samme struktur for "
"grupper/sektioner/felter. Når actions eller conditionals er inkluderet, "
"erstatter de formularens actions eller conditionals."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:361
msgid "Publish form"
msgstr "Udgiv formular"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:362
msgid ""
"When a form is created in WS Form it initially has a status of draft. Use "
"this to publish a form by ID so that it can be used on a live web page."
msgstr ""
"Når en formular oprettes i WS Form, har den i første omgang status som "
"kladde. Brug dette til at udgive en formular efter ID, så den kan bruges på "
"en live webside."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:416
msgid "Draft form"
msgstr "Kladdeformular"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:417
msgid ""
"Set a published form back to draft by ID. Draft forms cannot be used on live "
"web pages until they are published again."
msgstr ""
"Sæt en udgivet formular tilbage til kladde efter ID. Kladdeformularer kan "
"ikke bruges på live websider, før de udgives igen."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:471
msgid "Clone form"
msgstr "Klon formular"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:472
msgid ""
"Use this tool to clone/copy/duplicate a form. The cloned form will be in a "
"draft state."
msgstr ""
"Brug dette værktøj til at klone/kopiere/duplikere en formular. Den klonede "
"formular vil være i kladdetilstand."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:558
msgid "Get form shortcode"
msgstr "Hent formular-shortcode"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:559
msgid ""
"Gets a shortcode for a form in the WS Form form plugin for WordPress by form "
"ID."
msgstr ""
"Henter en shortcode til en formular i WS Form-formularpluginet til WordPress "
"efter formular-ID."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:613
msgid "Get form block markup"
msgstr "Hent formular-blokmarkup"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:614
msgid ""
"Gets the block markup for a form in WS Form by form ID. This should only be "
"used for pages edited by the block editor (Gutenberg)."
msgstr ""
"Henter blok-markup for en formular i WS Form efter formular-ID. Dette bør "
"kun bruges til sider, der redigeres med blokeditoren (Gutenberg)."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:668
msgid "Get statistical data about a form by ID"
msgstr "Hent statistiske data om en formular efter ID"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:669
msgid ""
"Returns statistical data about a form by ID including total views, saves, "
"submissions, daily figures, as well as the total number of submission "
"records and how many of those are unread."
msgstr ""
"Returnerer statistiske data om en formular efter ID, herunder samlede "
"visninger, gemninger, indsendelser, daglige tal samt det samlede antal "
"indsendelsesposter, og hvor mange af dem der er ulæste."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:817
msgid "List submissions"
msgstr "Vis indsendelser"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:818
msgid ""
"Returns a list of submissions for a form by ID. Supports optional date "
"range, status, keyword search, pagination, and ordering."
msgstr ""
"Returnerer en liste over indsendelser for en formular efter ID. Understøtter "
"valgfrit datointerval, status, nøgleordssøgning, sideinddeling og sortering."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1029
msgid "Get submission"
msgstr "Hent indsendelse"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1030
msgid "Returns a single submission by ID including its field values."
msgstr "Returnerer en enkelt indsendelse efter ID, inklusive dens feltværdier."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1163
msgid "List submission notes"
msgstr "Vis liste over indsendelsesnoter"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1164
msgid "Returns notes for a submission by ID."
msgstr "Returnerer noter for en indsendelse efter id."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1285
msgid "Create submission note"
msgstr "Opret indsendelsesnote"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1286
msgid "Creates a note on a submission."
msgstr "Opretter en note på en indsendelse."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1366
msgid "Update submission note"
msgstr "Opdater indsendelsesnote"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1367
msgid "Updates a submission note by ID."
msgstr "Opdaterer en indsendelsesnote efter id."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1447
msgid "Delete submission note"
msgstr "Slet indsendelsesnote"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1448
msgid "Deletes a submission note by ID."
msgstr "Sletter en indsendelsesnote efter ID."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1508
msgid "Delete form"
msgstr "Slet formular"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1509
msgid "Trash or permanently delete a form by ID."
msgstr "Flyt til papirkurven eller slet en formular permanent efter id."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1592
msgid "Restore form"
msgstr "Gendan formular"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1593
msgid "Restore a form from the trash by ID."
msgstr "Gendan en formular fra papirkurven efter ID."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1661
msgid "Add field"
msgstr "Tilføj felt"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1662
msgid ""
"Use this tool to add or insert a new field into a form. Use the sections or "
"fields tools (or form-get-json) to get section_id, and optionally "
"field_id_before to insert before another field."
msgstr ""
"Brug dette værktøj til at tilføje eller indsætte et nyt felt i en formular. "
"Brug værktøjerne til sektioner eller felter (eller form-get-json) til at få "
"section_id og eventuelt field_id_before for at indsætte før et andet felt."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1784
msgid "Update field"
msgstr "Opdater felt"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1785
msgid ""
"Use this tool to update an existing field label and/or meta (required, "
"placeholder, help, options, etc.). Prefer this over form-update-json for "
"single-field changes. Field type cannot be changed. Use the fields tool to "
"find field IDs, or form-get-json for full field meta."
msgstr ""
"Brug dette værktøj til at opdatere en eksisterende feltetiket og/eller meta "
"(påkrævet, pladsholder, hjælp, valgmuligheder osv.). Foretræk dette frem for "
"form-update-json ved ændringer af et enkelt felt. Felttypen kan ikke ændres. "
"Brug feltværktøjet til at finde felt-id'er, eller form-get-json for fulde "
"felt-meta."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1893
msgid "Delete field"
msgstr "Slet felt"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-ability.php:1894
msgid "Use this tool to delete a field from a form."
msgstr "Brug dette værktøj til at slette et felt fra en formular."

